":"Magnum Ice Cream (MICC) Reaches New Heights Post-Demerger","url":"https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8552392/magnum-ice-cream-micc-reaches-new-heights-postdemerger"},{"date":"2026-01-27","description":"Magnum plans complete modernization of top 30% revenue-generating stores by 2026 and launch of new game mechanics.[3]","source":"Porters Five Force","title":"Magnum Company Growth Strategy and Future Prospects","url":"https://portersfiveforce.com/blogs/growth-strategy/magnum"},{"date":"2026-01-16","description":"Forecasts show revenue reaching 8,897 and earnings 754 by 12/31/2028, with updates for 2026-2028 periods.[1]","source":"Simply Wall St","title":"Magnum Ice Cream Earnings Forecasts Updated","url":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-micc/magnum-ice-cream/future"},{"date":"2026-01-26","description":"Latest company analysis updated on 2026/01/26, with end of day share price as of 2026/01/23 and earnings to 2025/06/30.[1]","source":"Simply Wall St","title":"Company Analysis Data Refreshed for Magnum Ice Cream","url":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-micc/magnum-ice-cream/future"},{"date":"2026-01-16","description":"Food sector earnings growth at 18.4%, with Magnum's revenue growth rate at 3.2% and good analyst coverage.[1]","source":"Simply Wall St","title":"Magnum Ice Cream Sector Earnings Growth at 18.4%","url":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-micc/magnum-ice-cream/future"}],"recentPost":"No recent posts found; digital footprint emphasizes leadership in data technologies and employability-focused education.","recommendations":[],"scrapedFile":null,"searchAppearancesLast7Days":null,"status":"COMPLETED","timing":{"bestTimes":["Tuesday afternoons UTC","Post-industry news drops like today","Q1 growth planning"],"tactics":["Reference fresh news like Magnum's modernization","Email with ROI calc tied to their scale"]},"topSkills":["Digital Transformation","Enterprise IT Strategy","AI Strategy",